  "description": "No roads. No limits. Only the path you choose.\n\nTake control of powerful 4x4 vehicles and explore wild, unpredictable environments where every decision matters. In Offroad Craft Runner 4x4 Simulator, the focus is not speed — it’s control, planning, and the ability to overcome challenging terrain.\n\nDrive through mud, snow, sand, and rocky landscapes where each surface affects your movement and forces you to adapt. Choosing the right path becomes essential as you navigate through difficult conditions, avoid hazards, and complete missions in remote locations.\n\nEvery mission is an expedition. You deliver cargo, locate objectives, rescue targets, and explore unknown areas while managing your vehicle’s performance. Damage, terrain resistance, and route selection all impact your progress, making each journey a test of skill and patience.\n\nThere are no fixed roads — you decide how to reach your destination. Explore different routes, discover hidden areas, and uncover pieces of a larger story as you move through diverse environments inspired by real-world locations\n\nKey Features:\n\t•\tDrive through terrain that constantly pushes your control\n\t•\tPlan your route instead of following fixed roads\n\t•\tComplete missions built around exploration and precision\n\t•\tManage your vehicle and overcome natural obstacles\n\t•\tProgress through increasingly demanding environments\nTake your time, choose your path, and push your limits.\nIn Offroad Craft Runner 4x4 Simulator, every journey is about control, strategy, and exploration.",
